{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bvSrq49lN01792751632.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產新界東豪宅白石角分行經理曾嘉滙表示，近期二手交投氣氛持續暢旺，不少買家加快入市，大埔白石角University Hill 2B期最新錄3座低層A2室，單位實用面積439平方呎，2房間隔，日前議價後以666萬元沽出，實用面積呎價約15,171元。<br/>中原曾嘉匯表示，新買家為投資者，見屋苑環境舒適，單位價錢合理，即購入單位投資收租，單位市值月租約18,000至20,000元，買家料可享約3.2至3.6厘租金回報。據了解，原業主於2023年以695萬元購入上址，持貨約3年，現轉手賬面蝕約29萬元或4.2%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:40.082058+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T00:38:21.069835+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:25.766853+00:00","content_hash":"0957e255245fc793832e1a044bd8b65791d68851e1937366d0232b3a7035eaec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:40.082058+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}